Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: statement_list

    2 statement_list: statement
    3               | statement_list statement

    4 statement: declaration_stmt
    5          | assignment_stmt
    6          | expression SEMICOLON
    7          | if_stmt
    8          | while_stmt
    9          | for_stmt
   10          | switch_stmt
   11          | function_decl
   12          | do_while_stmt
   13          | return_stmt

   14 declaration_stmt: type IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   15                 | CONST type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   16                 | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   17 type: INT
   18     | FLOAT_TYPE
   19     | STRING_TYPE
   20     | CHAR_TYPE

   21 assignment_stmt: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   22 assign: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   23 expression: expression PLUS T
   24           | expression MINUS T
   25           | T

   26 T: T MULTIPLY F
   27  | T DIVIDE F
   28  | T MODULO F
   29  | F

   30 F: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   31  | MINUS F
   32  | IDENTIFIER
   33  | IDENTIFIER LPAREN argument_list RPAREN
   34  | IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN
   35  | FLOAT
   36  | NUMBER

   37 condition: expression EQUAL expression
   38          | expression NOT_EQUAL expression
   39          | expression LESS_THAN expression
   40          | expression GREATER_THAN expression
   41          | expression LESS_EQUAL expression
   42          | expression GREATER_EQUAL expression
   43          | expression AND expression
   44          | expression OR expression
   45          | NOT expression

   46 if_stmt: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   47        | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE ELSE LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   48 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   49 for_stmt: FOR LPAREN declaration_stmt condition SEMICOLON assign RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   50 switch_stmt: SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list RBRACE
   51            | SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list default_case RBRACE

   52 case_list: case_stmt
   53          | case_list case_stmt

   54 case_stmt: CASE expression COLON statement_list
   55          | CASE expression COLON statement_list BREAK SEMICOLON

   56 default_case: DEFAULT COLON statement_list
   57             | DEFAULT COLON statement_list BREAK SEMICOLON

   58 function_decl: type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   59              | type IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   60              | VOID_TYPE IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   61 parameter_list: parameter
   62               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   63 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   64 return_stmt: RETURN expression SEMICOLON
   65            | RETURN SEMICOLON

   66 do_while_stmt: DO LBRACE statement_list RBRACE WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN SEMICOLON

   67 argument_list: expression
   68              | argument_list COMMA expression


Terminals, with rules where they appear

$end (0) 0
error (256)
INT (258) 17
FLOAT_TYPE (259) 18
STRING_TYPE (260) 19
CHAR_TYPE (261) 20
CONST (262) 15
IF (263) 46 47
