    on left: 17 18 19 20, on right: 14 15 16 58 59 63
assignment_stmt (50)
    on left: 21, on right: 5
assign (51)
    on left: 22, on right: 49
expression (52)
    on left: 23 24 25, on right: 6 15 16 21 22 23 24 30 37 38 39 40
    41 42 43 44 45 54 55 64 67 68
